{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"]}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and look after them once they’re held."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer offers credentials with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a QR code or a link the holder opens. Register the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so links"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"open the app, and hand the link to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolves the offer and the issuer’s metadata, and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you show the holder: who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offering what."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offer names one of two grants:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Authorization code:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" the holder signs in at the issuer’s pages, in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a browser, which redirects back to the wallet’s redirect URI.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pre-authorized code:","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" the issuer has already authenticated the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder, and may ask for a PIN it sent them separately","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Either way, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" then requests, checks and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stores the credentials, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" ends the issuance."}]},{"anchor":"Receive-an-offer","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Receive an offer"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import AuthenticationServices","import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Receives the credentials an offer link offers. `askPIN` asks the","\/\/\/ holder for the PIN the issuer sent, or returns nil if they cancel;","\/\/\/ `signIn` opens the issuer's page and returns the redirect back.","func receive(offerLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             askPIN: (Offer.TxCode?) async -> String?,","             signIn: (URL) async throws -> URL) async throws -> Issuance.Result? {","    let issuance = try await wallet.startIssuance(offer: offerLink)","    switch issuance.offer.grant {","    case .preAuthorizedCode:","        while true {","            guard let pin = await askPIN(issuance.offer.txCode) else {","                try await issuance.close()","                return nil","            }","            do {","                try await issuance.redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin: pin)","                break","            } catch let error as WalletError where error.isRetryable {","                continue \/\/ A wrong PIN (invalid_grant): ask again.","            }","        }","    case .authorizationCode:","        let url = try await issuance.beginAuthorization()","        let redirect = try await signIn(url)","        try await issuance.completeAuthorization(redirect: redirect)","    }","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists what arrived, what the issuer deferred, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what failed: one credential the issuer refused doesn’t hold up the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest."}]},{"anchor":"Open-the-issuers-page","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Open the issuer’s page"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the authorization URL in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"type":"text","text":", with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect URI’s scheme as its callback scheme. An ephemeral session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the issuer’s cookies out of Safari’s."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Opens issuers' authorization pages over `window`.","@MainActor","final class IssuerSignIn: NSObject, ASWebAuthenticationPresentationContextProviding {","    private let window: ASPresentationAnchor","    private let callbackScheme: String","","    init(window: ASPresentationAnchor, callbackScheme: String) {","        self.window = window","        self.callbackScheme = callbackScheme","    }","","    nonisolated func presentationAnchor(for session: ASWebAuthenticationSession) -> ASPresentationAnchor {","        MainActor.assumeIsolated { window }","    }","","    \/\/\/ The issuer's redirect back, or `ASWebAuthenticationSessionError`","    \/\/\/ `.canceledLogin` when the holder closes the page.","    func open(_ url: URL) async throws -> URL {","        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in","            let session = ASWebAuthenticationSession(url: url, callbackURLScheme: callbackScheme) { redirect, error in","                if let redirect {","                    continuation.resume(returning: redirect)","                } else {","                    continuation.resume(throwing: error ?? URLError(.unknown))","                }","            }","            session.presentationContextProvider = self","            session.prefersEphemeralWebBrowserSession = true","            session.start()","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the holder closes the page, the offer stays open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can begin again. A redirect is used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up by "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" whatever happens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so after a failure there, begin again rather than retrying it."}]},{"anchor":"Resume-after-the-app-is-killed","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Resume after the app is killed"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS can terminate the app while the holder is at the issuer’s pages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The authorization in progress is kept in the credential store, so when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the redirect arrives at a relaunched app, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completes it and returns an issuance ready for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Handle every redirect this way: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Completes an authorization the app was killed during, from the","\/\/\/ redirect iOS delivers to the relaunched app.","func resume(redirect: URL, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> Issuance.Result {","    let issuance = try await wallet.resumeIssuance(redirect: redirect)","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A redirect that matches no authorization in progress throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Wait-for-a-deferred-credential","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Wait for a deferred credential"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer may issue a credential later, after a review, say. It’s kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"survives the app quitting. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" lists them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without network requests; poll each at the interval the issuer asks for."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Polls a deferred credential until the issuer settles it: the","\/\/\/ credential, or a `.credentialDenied` error.","func waitFor(_ deferred: DeferredCredential, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> CredentialSummary {","    var interval = deferred.intervalSeconds","    while true {","        try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(max(interval, 5)))","        switch try await wallet.pollDeferred(id: deferred.id) {","        case .issued(let credential): return credential","        case .pending(let next): interval = next","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" gives one up, deleting its keys: once"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its access token has expired, say ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"anchor":"Look-after-held-credentials","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Look after held credentials"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" lists them, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns one with its claims, for display. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries the issuer’s names, logos and colours, in the holder’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"language (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" checks revocation against the issuer’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"status list, which covers many credentials, so the issuer can’t tell","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which one is checked.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each credential arrives as a batch of copies, each bound to its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key (","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"), so presentations can’t be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"linked by the credential. When ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reaches zero, ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" replaces them without","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the holder, if the issuance kept a refresh token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"). Otherwise it throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":": receive the credential again.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" deletes a credential and its keys,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"revoking its refresh token at the issuer.","type":"text"}]}]}]}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Receiving-credentials","title":"Receiving credentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"metadata":{"title":"Receiving credentials","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredCredential/accessTokenExpiresAt":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessTokenExpiresAt"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Date","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"When the access token it’s polled with expires, if the issuer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"said: after it, polls fail and it can only be abandoned.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"accessTokenExpiresAt","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/deferredcredential\/accesstokenexpiresat","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/close()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Ends the issuance, deleting its keys but those its deferred"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials still poll with."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"close"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/close()","type":"topic","title":"close()","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/notFound":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"No key, credential, deferred credential or authorization in progress"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with that ID."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"notFound","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Code","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/notfound","type":"topic","title":"notFound","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receives one offer’s credentials: show "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"offer"},{"type":"text","text":"; then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"beginAuthorization()"},{"type":"text","text":", open the URL in ASWebAuthenticationSession and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completeAuthorization(redirect:)"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin:)"},{"type":"text","text":";"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"requestCredentials()"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"close()"},{"type":"text","text":" when done."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Issuance"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Issuance"}],"title":"Issuance","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/credentials()":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/credentials()","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","title":"credentials()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"credentials","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"CredentialSummary","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialSummaryV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Every credential the wallet holds.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/batchSize":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchSize"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How many copies of each credential to request when an issuer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offers batches, each bound to its own key, so each presentation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can use one no Verifier has seen. 0 means the SDK’s default (5);"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it’s capped at the issuer’s batch size."}],"type":"topic","title":"batchSize","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/batchsize","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/reissueRequired":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential can’t be refreshed: no refresh token was kept, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Authorization Server no longer accepts it. Receive it again"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from a new offer."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reissueRequired"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WalletError","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Code","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/reissuerequired","type":"topic","title":"reissueRequired","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/credential(id:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One credential with its claims."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"credential"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16CredentialDetailV","text":"CredentialDetail"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/credential(id:)","type":"topic","title":"credential(id:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredCredential":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredCredential","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential an issuer will issue later (OpenID4VCI 1.0 §9). It’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so it survives the app quitting."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DeferredCredential","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DeferredCredential","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/deferredcredential","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","type":"topic","title":"OID4VCWallet","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/abandonDeferred(id:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Gives up on a deferred credential — its access token has expired,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"say, or the holder no longer wants it — deleting it and its keys."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"abandonDeferred"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"id"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/abandondeferred(id:)","type":"topic","title":"abandonDeferred(id:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/checkStatus(id:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fetches the issuer’s status list for a credential, checks its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signature, and returns the credential with its revocation status"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recorded. The list covers many credentials, so fetching it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t tell the issuer which one is checked. A credential without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a status list is returned as it is."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"id","kind":"externalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialSummaryV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CredentialSummary"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/checkstatus(id:)","type":"topic","title":"checkStatus(id:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/completeAuthorization(redirect:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"completeAuthorization"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"redirect"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"URL","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Completes the authorization with the issuer’s redirect back. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect is used up whatever happens: if this fails — the token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text"